{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_huang_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_huang_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"你願意嗎","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_huang_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"6d78be08f61f9809d4ed37321ff1b27b25cf71bb320b8448ec4dd5e67a6603e4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在是否要成為羅德島的精英幹員一事上，凱爾希將會親自詢問煌本人的意願。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，前面這條路被堵死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這個方向也有人追過來了，不行，走不通！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"到此為止！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你們逃不掉的，把人交出來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"不能把這些感染者交給他們！等著，我去把堵在前面的人幹掉，你們趁機突圍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，別去，回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你冷靜點，現在不是逞英雄的時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"就是說啊，你都受傷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有可是，Ace老大那邊肯定會來支援的，我們不能慌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——說得好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這個聲音是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"頭，小心！嘶，好熱——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"突然變熱了，怎麼回事......等下，那邊的牆壁連著堵塞物全都被......切開了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我們的支援來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"很熱？那真是不好意思，要切開這些東西太費勁了，有點用力過猛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"精密操作時的溫度調節我還在學，下次我再努力調整調整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這個電鋸......你就是Ace老大手下的那個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，是煌小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你總算來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！我來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"大家久等了，處理另一邊的追兵多費了點時間，一會其他小隊也會過來會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我們突圍，就按原計劃行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙怎麼做到的，居然切斷了最新材料的封鎖網？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起啊，我也沒想到會這麼順利，就那麼從上往下一切——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我們也沒必要爭個你死我活吧？別動我的同伴，讓我們帶著感染者同胞就這麼走，你們也沒什麼損失，各退一步怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是有必要，我也不想對你們動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一句話不說就攻擊也太過分了吧，好好溝通一下真有這麼難？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"煌！別和他們多說了，準備突圍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！那就讓溫度再升高一點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"最後說一句，變成這樣我是真的感覺挺遺憾的，這不是假話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"疼疼疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我的胳膊，哎呦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"前兩天強行用還在完善的那招，看來還是太勉強了......疼死我了，差點以為胳膊要斷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"推進的速率好像還是不太對，是我算錯了？可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人在這裡自言自語什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......怎麼是溫蒂啊，嚇了我一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"我才是被你嚇到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，不可以是我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"沒，我沒這個意思！就是這個時間在這裡看到你，有點驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"真難得，平常不到午餐晚餐之類的必要時候，你不是就只待在你那工作室裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候三餐你都能直接省了，我拉你都拉不出來耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有這麼誇張，我也是會需要出來透透氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，如果下次你再穿著外出的鞋就隨便進我的研究室，我就立刻取消你的進入權限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，我一定記住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"還有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"還有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......可以麻煩你把衣服穿好嗎？這裡，衣角這裡都皺起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？衣服？哪裡，這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"你在扯哪裡？等等，別這麼用力扯，這不是更亂了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"受不了了......停手，我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，謝謝啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是很在意這些欸，而且我聽說，你居然能讓可露希爾從工作室回來後都自覺洗手，這真不簡單......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，正好，溫蒂你很擅長念書對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"研究......算是擅長讀書嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"算！當然算，怎麼不算了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，其實我有點小問題想請教......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"真難得，你說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，其實是動力加速度的問題，還有摩擦阻力和能量膨脹算式，這些你一定都懂吧？能不能教教我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了，幹嘛摸我額頭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔，好像沒發燒啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然會問這方面的問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，外面現在真的是晴天嗎？還是突然下雨了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說嘛，雖然我確實完全不喜歡這個，但沒辦法，誰叫這真的很有用呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別說這麼多，你看看這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......這是，你在讀的書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"都是高等教材，還有這上面標出來的問題......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我收回之前說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"你確實有在努力。這些問題，不是隨便看看就能提得出來的，我得向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？不用，哈哈哈，不用這麼正經啦，我沒在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是只有溫蒂你這麼說啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我確實沒那麼聰明，這些東西學起來也很吃力，而且說到底搞這種學問和我完全不搭嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法。我想做的事還有很多，想要做到那些，就必須要變得更強才行。所以，任何有幫助的辦法我都會去試試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，讀書而已，總比在訓練場上被Ace像沙包一樣打上天來得要輕鬆吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，原來你就是這麼在背後說我壞話的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"看你這麼有精神我就放心了，煌。但你可別亂說話，帶壞溫蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪有帶壞溫蒂，這不是實話實說嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"上回Ace你和Mechanist給我特訓，我差點被你們從肚臍這直接拆成兩半！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"那還不是為了幫你調試新武器。要達到你想要的那種破壞力哪有那麼簡單，Mechanist為了這個好幾天沒離開工作台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"你該看看被他撕掉的那些草圖，這段時間他用掉的白紙多得能讓後勤部發怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這次也真多虧了他給我這個大傢伙，切起東西來特別順手......嘿，要不是有這個，我那新招估計還用不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"看！我還帶了敘拉古當地的乳酪回來當禮物，據說味道獨特，一會我就送去給Mechanist也嘗嘗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅聞）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"噁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我不確定他會不會喜歡這個味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，溫蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"請說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"關於之前你向工程部提出的申請，可露希爾已經把材料轉到了我們這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"我正準備去問她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我可完全沒想過會收到這種申請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"但既然你本人有這個意向，可露希爾又替你的工程產品做擔保，我們沒有拒絕的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"這也就是說，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎你成為正式幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這是刮的什麼風，溫蒂你居然會想上戰場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼意見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不是，當然不是！我很期待能和你一起作戰，絕對沒有小瞧你的意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，哎，你的身體狀況......真沒問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是會有想要改變一下的時候的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然體弱，但我也有擅長的領域。我的體能或許比不過大家，但可不要小看我的這些蓄水炮，它們的推力可能比煌你還要強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那可真是太可靠了！要是我們下回在同個小隊裡出任務，溫蒂你可要多關照我呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"......我考慮一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，你剛剛提的那些問題，還問不問？如果還要問，就晚上拿來讓我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"char_400_weedy","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣，我先走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，什麼情況？她那樣算是......害羞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"這話我覺得你還是別當著她的面說比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"才不會，我有分寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......之前的任務記錄還是得回去再整理一遍，雖然當時情急之下把新招給用出來了，但還是感覺差了點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"手感？不對，是更精密的計算問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是為了這個去借了高等課程的教材？我記得你很討厭這些公式和數字計算吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"當然討厭，我最近頭髮都掉得比之前多一倍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"但沒辦法，誰叫我的源石技藝不是那種能什麼都不想，直接一路碾過去的類型呢，要想做好現在的工作，就只能再努力點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是嗎，那真不錯。你這樣我也能放心不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，Mechanist那邊也還在做改進，記得多找他溝通，讓他再給你看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，我回頭就去找他！就算這次再被晾在門口敲幾個小時的門，我也一定不抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒也不至於，你們應該很快就能見面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生已經和你說過那件事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......那個啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，聽說你找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？你看起來好嚴肅，是有什麼很重要的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我認為這件事確實很重要。不管是對於你自身，還是對於羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，你這樣說話，我開始有點緊張起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你加入多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我算算，差不多也有一年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"時間過得真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"時間一直將我們所有人拋在身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這一年你的成長有目共睹，或許你沒有要透過這樣的行動證明什麼的意圖，但結果上，你的確向所有人證明了你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace，還有其他幹員，對你的評價都很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛突然說這個，這麼被人當面誇還有點害羞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的體溫很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我那是強行在忍著呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，你已經能預想到我是為什麼找你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"大概......有那麼點猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我就直說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島建立以來，有許多人加入，也有人離開，我不會對此多說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一直歡迎與我們有共同想法的人，但任何一種思想都不該是強制的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但......羅德島確實需要能和我們同行的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，如果你還沒有做好準備，我認為那也很正常。沒人會逼迫你做任何事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果你已經準備好了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"到艦橋下層來，打開樓梯左邊的那扇門。我們會在那裡等你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......她是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace，你知道凱爾希醫生說的是什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"真的需要我直說？你不是說自己已經有猜測了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"確實......是有啦。不過總還是有點沒底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓那個凱爾希醫生這麼正式地找我通知的事，左右就那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......是不是我也有機會和Ace你做真正的同僚了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多。看來你確實心裡有數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我又不傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，但是怎麼說呢，像做夢一樣，挺不真實的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，其實我從來沒覺得我有哪裡比其他人更強，比起你們，我差得遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，煌，你在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我找你好久了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，是小兔子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"找我？哎，小心點，別摔了......這次怎麼這麼熱情，我好高興啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？哎，等咦下煌你憋捏窩的臉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼小氣嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"（看來有些話不用我來說了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米婭，就交給你了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"加油吧。一會見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？等等，Ace......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"走掉了。這傢伙跑那麼快幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace先生應該是還有別的工作要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對了，煌！你已經吃過東西了嗎？今天食堂做了你喜歡的炒菜，要不要一起去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"還有上回你說喜歡的那張CD，我問幹員極境借來了......要一起聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，欸，是那傢伙特別寶貝的那張？要聽，當然要聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......怎麼了小兔子，你今天真的熱情得有點反常哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，很明顯嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"超級明顯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，對不起，煌，我剛剛稍微聽到了一點你和Ace先生的對話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣，別在意，來笑一笑，嗯，這樣就對了。別垮著臉，沒必要道歉啊，本來也就沒什麼要隱瞞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你也聽到了，就像我和Ace說的那樣，凱爾希為什麼找我，我大概能猜到一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我想得沒錯，阿米婭你應該也是知情的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"果然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你剛剛那是怕我有壓力，想逗我開心？你可真可愛，阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你別總說這種話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不逗你了，說正經的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我啊，確實沒那麼有自信，總覺得自己還差得遠呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，你看，沒有Mechanist設計的武器，之前的任務我想救援小隊都很難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，阿米婭，我真的可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛剛我聽到煌問Ace先生的問題，就覺得一定要把我的想法說出來才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽著呢。阿米婭，你的話我一向都有好好聽著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌是為了獲得某種頭銜才努力的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧！煌你不是為了成為什麼而努力，實際上恰好相反，正因為煌你是這樣的人，我們才會認為你適合某種位置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，大家已經都很信任你了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"從敘拉古任務中回來的小隊成員，都對我這樣說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“多虧了煌”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果沒有最後切開牆體的大個子，任務不可能順利完成”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"也、也不是我厲害，是多虧了Mechanist給我的裝備......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果不是煌，這種特製的大型裝備，其他人根本沒有辦法很好地使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是煌，Ace先生或許也會選擇更穩妥的戰術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，煌已經是大家信賴的對象，是團隊裡不可缺少的一份子了。其實這才是最重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想說——不是我們給你頭銜，讓你承擔一種身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而是煌你自己的行動決定了這一切。是你自己選擇成為某種人，選擇擔起一種責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們想要的只是強大的戰力，那換個其他人也可以。想要強大的怪物，這個人不是煌也一樣可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太喜歡怪物這個詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我不是那個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我只是想說！羅德島需要的不是只有實力的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌要對自己更有信心一點。也要對我們更有信心一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你已經做好了決定，我會陪著你一起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，好了好了......哎，我都要臉紅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了小兔子。我明白你的意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對。哎呀，你怎麼這麼會說話啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，時間也差不多了，我該打起精神去赴約啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我可從來沒考慮過臨陣脫逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我、我陪你一起過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！那我們一起走一段，放輕鬆。你怎麼看起來比我還緊張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"有。笑一笑，板著臉就不可愛了哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯，這樣就對了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，不會讓你失望的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌走過昏暗的長走廊。頭頂的燈光隨著艦船的行進緩緩搖動，在地上晃動出她的影子。\n這一路上，阿米婭一直陪在她的身邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她推開那扇門。\n向下的樓梯昏暗幽長，仿若沒有盡頭。煌深吸一口氣，她走下去，將阿米婭留在身後。\n這一段路，必須由她獨自來走。\n她看到樓梯露出盡頭，她看到盡頭處溢出微光，她看到構造冰冷的房間正中放著一張長桌，暖黃的燈光落在四周冰冷的鋼筋鐵骨上。\n在燈光下，站著幾個或熟悉或陌生的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從陰影中走出一個意料之中的熟悉的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有猜到會挺正式的，但還是沒想到會是這種陣仗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace，還有Mechanist你們居然都在。呃，還有這位......Logos先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必行禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，有你們在總覺得放鬆多了，剛進門的時候氣氛真有點嚇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我可是你的保薦人，這種時候不能不出現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，原來你這麼膽小？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"站著說話不腰疼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，別耍嘴皮了，說正事吧。......哎，正好結束之後你和我去工坊，把你手裡的傢伙再調試一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我還給你帶了禮物呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，別打岔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼我們長話短說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島前線作戰小隊，Ace分隊所屬，攻堅手煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個房間內所有人的見證下，我需要徵詢你的意見，詢問你的選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幹員煌，你願意成為羅德島的精英幹員嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_400_weedy","aliases":["溫蒂"]}]}
